description: Data access — repository layer only
globs:
  - "src/lib/repositories/**/*.ts"
  - "src/lib/services/**/*.ts"
  - "src/app/api/**/*.ts"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Repository Layer

- **Data access** only in `src/lib/repositories/`. One file per domain; plain exported functions with typed args and returns.
- **No Drizzle in** services, route handlers, Server Actions, or components.
- **Services** = business logic and orchestration; **repositories** = all DB access.
- **Phase 1 exception**: In-memory or sessionStorage preview state is fine without repositories until Phase 2 persistence lands.

When adding persistence (Phase 2+): add repository first, then wire services and API routes to it.
